{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんにちは！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "エイに似てるねってたまに言われます"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "四期生の中川智尋です( ´~`   )"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "口が似てるらしいです"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "結構嬉しいです🐳"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobKJtHkn.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最近お気に入りの1枚♡"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "わこちー、ちーわこ、なかがわこ"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "色々な名前で私たちのことを呼んでくださる方が多いのですが"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "“一輪車姉妹”はどうですか！？🎪"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ふたりで考えてみたんだよ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "うーん、やっぱり名前がいいかな？"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "好きなように呼んでくださると嬉しいです！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私たちのペアを好きと言ってくださる方が多いので、いつかふたりでシンメの楽曲があったらいいななんて夢見てます🐑"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ちょっぴり遅くなってしまいましたが…！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "14thオンラインミーグリ"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ありがとうございました🌸"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "たくさんたくさんありがとう（ ;  ; ）"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いつも楽しみにしてるんだよ"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "お顔みただけで幸せになれるよ〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "5/30 🗓"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mob64pqGP.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mob9BZyZp.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "くまやねこに見せかけて、"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "実は犬柄のパジャマでした！"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "リラックスしてお話できて楽しかった〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "またパジャマミーグリやりたいな🗣︎💬"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "5/31 🗓"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobNVm3vd.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "人生初めてこんなにおでこを出したよ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "見られるのが恥ずかしかったので、"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "セルフタイマーで写真を撮ってみました😹"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "また気が向いたら出してみます…(  ᯅ̈ )"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "15thSingleのオンラインミーグリは"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "日曜日から始まります！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "お休みの日に可愛いお洋服買ってきたよ"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "特別だもんね＾＾"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "楽しみにしています！"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobYNDuvk.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "またね"}], "source": "official"}